{"overview":"Ayan, Maharajah of Eschnapur, believes that his wife, Princess Savitri, has been unfaithful to him with officer Mac Allan. He decides to bury her alive, so he sends the Yogi Ramigani to England to look for Herbert Rowland, an architect; but when he orders him to build a tomb, Rowland refuses.","tagline":"","cast":[{"n":"Olaf Fønss","c":"Herbert Rowland","p":"/h1LNGzDGV9oFGkjAEslI4LnO7xS.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Mia May","c":"Irene Amundsen, Rowland's Fiancée","p":"/xb3X3Nwql9MKEzYlE3VqVK4KPx7.jpg","q":"Q90147"},{"n":"Conrad Veidt","c":"Ayan, Majarajah of Eschnapur","p":"/rmlK341dwK57BVWz1S96tpv7SSF.jpg","q":"Q58801"},{"n":"Erna Morena","c":"Princess Savitri","p":"/rqXp6pdBr76EP1dntK27Tv9O2Qk.jpg","q":"Q71472"},{"n":"Bernhard Goetzke","c":"Yogi Ramigani","p":"/aWymfDS3b84yh2mkkpk96dtImsj.jpg","q":"Q66861"},{"n":"Lya De Putti","c":"Mirrjha, Savitri's Servant","p":"/lc9XgYy2WifsuXLBL1qoOZjDSaO.jpg","q":"Q443766"},{"n":"Paul Richter","c":"Mac Allan, English Officer","p":"/eYb8PlCz6So4PUWoFe5auV7zeKo.jpg","q":"Q79047"},{"n":"Karl Platen","c":"Rowland's Servant","p":"/pD8jhGfCS1Dw8AZYZIh1TcwEWKS.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Hermann Picha","c":"Professor Leyden, an Orientalist","p":"/rHNFH1lDVQOVioEHNTLhfGPYi0X.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Wilhelm Diegelmann","c":"Captain","p":"/y0jZcLkhTZLAxHSQMijnPyjl2Af.jpg","q":null}],"country":["Germany"],"language":[],"wiki":null,"qid":"Q3702920"}